{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06623","headline":"山中贻崔六琪华 · 储光羲","name":"山中贻崔六琪华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恍惚登高岭，裴回看落日。\n遥想仲长园，如亲幼安室。\n春渚菖蒲登，山中拨谷鸣。\n相思不道远，太息未知情。\n意君来此地，时复疎林薄。\n中夜扫闲门，迎晨闭菌阁。\n屣履清池上，家童奉信归。\n忧随落花散，目送归云飞。\n故交在天末，心知复千里。\n无人暂往来，独作中林士。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}